The checks show the target tests and typecheck pass, but the live integration is not actually wired to a Portal authority: `portal.config.ts` has no game extension/webhook, so `ext.match` can never provide the snapshot, while vote actions are published as ordinary room messages and would be visible/persisted to every participant. I’m applying only safe, branch-local hardening now: remove the unchecked event cast, validate snapshot structure, prevent action-envelope overwrites, and fix submission state across reconnects/new rounds.
